Z||000003||DJRice||12-07-2000||09:23 PM||||The little blue dingy thingy is the optional chime unit.  It is a small blue box that plugs into a harness mounted under the dashboard passengers side on the heater core housing.  You cant miss it.  <P>------------------<BR>Dillon<BR>Black '87 SE V6<BR>"You mean like the back seat of a Volkswagen?"||||reg||1
